    Update Whisper.cpp defaults to reflect new binary names (#6794)
    
    The default binary names of Whisper.cpp have changed. This patch adjusts
    the Opencast code to reflect the new binary names. For more details, see
    the deprecation warning at
    
    https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp/tree/v1.7.5/examples/deprecation-warning
    
    Starting with Opencast 18, this change will also be included in
    Opencast's package repository. The additional change to the default
    model folder is done to also match the packages.
    
    
